(piecewise-thrust)
*title Full table piecewise thrust
*atmos none
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=20925646.3255 y=0 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=0 zdt=0 time=0 mass=10
  *file piecewise.dat time xecfc xecfcdt thrust
  *segment 1 burn
    *integ dtprnt=0.25 dt=0.025
    *inertial ecfc
    *prop thrust=(piecewise-thrust-table) mdot=0
    *fly yawi=0
    *fly pitchi=0
    *fly rolli=0
    *when time=5 stop
*end
